00:18:55.960 --> 00:18:57.250
For them to cancel, right?

00:18:57.320 --> 00:18:58.350
Units need to cancel.

00:18:59.340 --> 00:19:01.549
This would leave you with 0.

00:19:01.550 --> 00:19:03.360
792 grams on top.

